      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is not only an issue of the last couple weeks, this is a long running issue for  many years. Iirc the issue is related do to that the websockets are read-only and the connection never gets terminated. For the game the websocket is still connected. Because they are read-only there is no way to check if the ws connection is still getting messages send or a dead tunnel. That's why you never see any \"Lost connection to VRChat\" message.",
